    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="B14n0087-start">
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b12.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Míng Sì Míng Chǔshí Fànqí Shǒu Hé</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b13.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Míng Xī Wú Shíshù Jìyuè Zài Hé</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b14.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">○ Hánshān Shī</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">I divined my dwelling place among layered cliffs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">The bird path cuts off traces of people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">What is there within my courtyard?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">White clouds embrace secluded stones.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">How many years have I lived here?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">I have repeatedly seen the changing of spring and winter.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">I send a message to the families of bells and tripods (officials).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Empty fame is definitely without benefit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b15.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">I read Hánshān's poems.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">I search for bird tracks in emptiness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Who can nod in agreement?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Only the stone beneath the pine tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Not one word can be added.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">How can a thousand pieces of gold exchange it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">To clutch one's heart and imitate Xī Shī</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">To invite ridicule, not to seek benefit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b17.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Riding on the sunset, I enter deep into the village.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Green moss transforms into traces.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Smiling, I watch the cowherd.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">An old woodcutter's stone in an empty mountain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">In the end, where does the cow return?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">The stone cannot be exchanged.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Flowers and grass all forget words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:22:11.614+09:00">Who gains or loses within this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0737b19.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">All who read my poems,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">must guard purity in their hearts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Stinginess and greed will become daily honesty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">flattery and deceit will instantly become uprightness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Expel and banish evil deeds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">take refuge and receive true nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Today, attain the Buddha body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">swiftly, swiftly, like a command!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a01.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Let the body be like a withered tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">and the heart be as pure as the lotus flower.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">The myriad good deeds share the same path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the thousand evils all submit to righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Do not stray from the appearance of words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">but do not immediately grasp the nature of *tathatā*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">In the vastness between heaven and earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">all must follow the Dharma King's commands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a03.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">The autumn sky is as clean as if washed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">my thoughts return to purity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">The mountains are high, severing worldly ties,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the shadows of the trees forget bias and correctness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">The forest air nourishes simple thoughts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the heavenly fragrance suits the wild nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Remember today's date,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the order comes when the wild geese arrive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a05.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Laughable is Hánshān's 寒山 way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">without traces of carriages and horses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">The winding streams are difficult to record,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the layered peaks make one lose track of the height.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Dew-weeping are a thousand kinds of grasses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">wind-whistling are the same pines.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">At this time, lost on the path,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">the body asks the shadow where it comes from.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a07.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a09.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Hánshān 寒山 cannot be seen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a09.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">I search for traces left on the rocks.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#B14n0087_CBETA_１-0738a09.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-01T14:23:09.518+09:00">Where are the wooden clogs hidden?</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
